WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.157 --> 00:00:03.347
- She thinks I'm doing a
puppy video right now so...

00:00:07.191 --> 00:00:09.243
I have been considering getting a tattoo

00:00:09.243 --> 00:00:10.605
for a few years now.

00:00:10.605 --> 00:00:12.515
- It's crossed my mind, my
parents don't know that.

00:00:12.515 --> 00:00:14.201
They both like never had any tattoos.

00:00:14.201 --> 00:00:16.659
- I have occasionally
brought it up to my mom

00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:18.224
and she freaks out.

00:00:18.224 --> 00:00:19.585
- I'm actually kind of worried that

00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:22.068
he's going to lift up his shirt
and be like me too, twins!

00:00:22.068 --> 00:00:24.506
I'm going to be like no Dad, it's fake!

00:00:24.506 --> 00:00:26.294
- She might deny that it's real

00:00:26.294 --> 00:00:28.081
or she could burst into tears,

00:00:28.081 --> 00:00:30.357
third option I guess that she
could have a heart attack.

00:00:30.357 --> 00:00:31.922
- The tattoo I'm going to be getting

00:00:31.922 --> 00:00:34.563
is a flower, really girly and cute.

00:00:34.563 --> 00:00:35.640
I think it's believable.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.134
- I really hope that you have
an ambulance out on standby.

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:47.627
- [Interviewer] How was Dasha growing up?

00:00:47.627 --> 00:00:48.724
What kind of a kid was she?

00:00:48.724 --> 00:00:51.446
- Dasha was a smart girl, very practical

00:00:51.446 --> 00:00:53.498
and didn't get into a lot of trouble.

00:00:53.498 --> 00:00:55.428
- I think Jennifer was
born Miss Independent.

00:00:55.428 --> 00:00:57.696
From the very beginning
putting her in a stroller

00:00:57.696 --> 00:00:59.260
and she wouldn't stay in the stroller.

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:01.576
- Our relationship has matured

00:01:01.576 --> 00:01:03.588
and I think I could
tell you more things now

00:01:03.588 --> 00:01:05.030
which is good.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:06.798
- I think we're fairly
honest with each other.

00:01:06.798 --> 00:01:09.846
I mean I don't think we
share every little secret.

00:01:09.846 --> 00:01:13.299
- Yeah, I think I should tell you.

00:01:13.299 --> 00:01:14.336
- Uh oh.

00:01:14.336 --> 00:01:15.798
(laughs)

00:01:18.718 --> 00:01:20.390
- So I don't know how
you're going to react.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.014
- I got a tattoo.

00:01:22.841 --> 00:01:25.401
(laughs)

00:01:25.401 --> 00:01:26.782
- You're full of it.

00:01:26.782 --> 00:01:27.961
- I swear to God.

00:01:27.961 --> 00:01:28.794
- Show me.

00:01:28.794 --> 00:01:31.049
- Am I allowed to like
lift up my shirt on camera?

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:33.243
- Are you, are you joking, is it real?

00:01:33.243 --> 00:01:35.681
- It's a tattoo!

00:01:35.681 --> 00:01:37.745
- Oh my god!

00:01:37.745 --> 00:01:39.188
When did you get that?

00:01:39.188 --> 00:01:40.616
- A few weeks ago.

00:01:40.616 --> 00:01:41.910
- Is that real, Jen?

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:42.804
- Yeah.

00:01:42.804 --> 00:01:44.674
- Is that permanent, where did you go?

00:01:44.674 --> 00:01:46.421
- Santa Monica area.

00:01:46.421 --> 00:01:48.107
- You know hepatitis gets trans--

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:50.383
- See it's a flower, it's cute, right?

00:01:50.383 --> 00:01:52.130
- Well I don't know, looks like a wound.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.511
- Oh great!

00:01:53.511 --> 00:01:55.880
- Why do you do look so upset?

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.908
You look like you're going to cry.

00:01:58.908 --> 00:02:00.492
- You look like you're crying.

00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:02.707
- Well you're making me
feel shitty now about it.

00:02:02.707 --> 00:02:04.271
- Well it doesn't make me happy.

00:02:04.271 --> 00:02:04.995
- It's not on you.

00:02:04.995 --> 00:02:07.088
- Damn right it's not on me.

00:02:07.088 --> 00:02:10.095
- I just like felt inclined,
thought it was really cute.

00:02:10.095 --> 00:02:12.248
Maybe had a little bit to drink.

00:02:12.248 --> 00:02:13.549
- You didn't think about asking me

00:02:13.549 --> 00:02:15.723
or calling me or telling me or anything.

00:02:15.723 --> 00:02:18.364
- No, I was kind of worried
that you'd be upset.

00:02:18.364 --> 00:02:21.456
- Well it's, no I just
don't like that location.

00:02:21.456 --> 00:02:22.147
- Uh huh.

00:02:22.147 --> 00:02:23.833
- I think it doesn't look good.

00:02:23.833 --> 00:02:25.572
- Everyone else in the
family knew about it.

00:02:25.572 --> 00:02:27.055
- Everybody else knows?

00:02:27.055 --> 00:02:28.233
Your dad knows?

00:02:28.233 --> 00:02:29.859
- Dad knows, Jonathon knows.

00:02:29.859 --> 00:02:30.976
- Great.

00:02:30.976 --> 00:02:33.699
- Did you ask anybody else
about it or you just did it?

00:02:33.699 --> 00:02:36.279
- Yeah, I thought about
it, like some friends

00:02:36.279 --> 00:02:38.351
to see what they thought,
they said it was cute.

00:02:38.351 --> 00:02:40.119
- They might not let you
in the convent anymore now.

00:02:40.119 --> 00:02:41.805
- Yeah I know, I don't
know what I'm going to do.

00:02:41.805 --> 00:02:43.158
I'm kicked out for sure.

00:02:43.158 --> 00:02:44.824
- If Jennifer had asked me first

00:02:44.824 --> 00:02:47.465
if she could have a tattoo, I mean she,

00:02:47.465 --> 00:02:50.614
she's older, out of my control,

00:02:50.614 --> 00:02:53.906
I mean I'm not thrilled but I'm not,

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:55.958
there's too many other things that are,

00:02:55.958 --> 00:02:58.010
that could be far worse so...

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.623
- I have more thing to tell you.

00:03:00.623 --> 00:03:01.678
- Is there another thing?

00:03:01.678 --> 00:03:03.080
- Yeah.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.360
- But I hope that in the future

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.002
that if you want to do
something drastic like that

00:03:07.002 --> 00:03:08.322
that you'll let me know.

00:03:08.322 --> 00:03:10.283
- Okay, I'll make sure moving forward.

00:03:10.283 --> 00:03:11.258
- I'd feel better with that.

00:03:11.258 --> 00:03:13.291
- But I have one more secret actually.

00:03:13.291 --> 00:03:14.814
- Okay, what?

00:03:14.814 --> 00:03:17.680
- It's actually a fake tattoo!

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:18.343
- It's fake?

00:03:18.343 --> 00:03:19.462
- Yeah.

00:03:19.462 --> 00:03:20.883
(laughs)

00:03:20.883 --> 00:03:22.245
- And you didn't tell your dad?

00:03:22.245 --> 00:03:24.094
- No I did not tell Dad, Jonathon.

00:03:24.094 --> 00:03:27.100
- Oh, you are, you're such a great liar!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.848
- Did you really hate it that much?

00:03:28.848 --> 00:03:30.655
- When I get past the fact
that you're my daughter

00:03:30.655 --> 00:03:32.141
and you did the tattoo now.

00:03:32.141 --> 00:03:32.771
- Uh huh.

00:03:32.771 --> 00:03:34.640
- And I want to like critique that art.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:35.818
- So I should run it by you.

00:03:35.818 --> 00:03:37.444
- I appreciate it when Jennifer calls me

00:03:37.444 --> 00:03:39.658
and wants me to be with her for whatever.

00:03:39.658 --> 00:03:41.182
- So maybe I'll go get
a tattoo after this,

00:03:41.182 --> 00:03:42.138
you want to come?

00:03:42.138 --> 00:03:43.417
- Only if I can get a matching one.

00:03:43.417 --> 00:03:44.657
- Perfect, let's do it.

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:45.509
(laughs)

00:03:45.509 --> 00:03:48.055
So for putting you through this.

00:03:49.268 --> 00:03:54.268
